      "level": 2,
      "content": "20.Revision Points"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ichori0",
      "content": "1. Arthropoda is the largest phylum of Animal Kingdom."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7ipkqxf",
      "content": "2. Annelida is the first phylum with true coelom and closed circulatory system."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "k68fsuu",
      "content": "3. Pisces have a 2-chambered heart and are cold-blooded."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
